# placed. Separately the Ruins' first ability taps it for {C}: checked in the pool in a later main phase.

[Bot1 Deck]
Drannith Ruins
Ornithopter
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
